      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add to this, Amplify Shader Editor has some really nice shortcuts that would transfer over well. In Amplify you hold a hotkey and left-click to add a specific node.\n\nSo A + Click makes an \"Add\" node, S + Click makes \"Subtract\", 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 + Click make float, vector 2, vector 3, etc.\n\nWould love to see a system like that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
