      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplication shortcut is Ctrl+D in unity so should use that instead.\nAlso Esc is used for cancelling in-progress operation - in graph editor this should cancel node dragging or noodle (dis)connection.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-21T08:28:39.596Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "some things from blender's node editors that would be nice to see in udon!\n1. ctrl + drag to cut nodes with a drawn line\n2. shift + D to duplicate a node\n3. shift + A to bring up the add node menu below the cursor\n4. ctrl + scroll to zoom in and out of the node editor",
